tching terminal.go and stat.go (planning constitution P7).\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Copyright header and Implements comment must follow the exact pattern from terminal.go and stat.go: SPDX-License-Identifier MIT, then Implements line referencing prd002-sys requirement IDs.\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"pkg/sys/signal.go exists and compiles with no errors under go build ./pkg/sys/...\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"Exported functions cover all three signals listed in ARCHITECTURE.yaml pkg/sys capabilities: SIGPIPE, SIGHUP, SIGWINCH.\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"All exported functions have doc comments referencing prd002-sys requirement IDs, following the style in terminal.go (e.g., // Implements: prd002-sys (R3)).\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"No new external dependencies introduced -- implementation uses only Go standard library (os/signal, os, syscall). golang.org/x/sys is acceptable only if already used by the package.\"\n```","stop_reason":null,"session_id":"de956fdb-a353-4fbf-8618-db689ec3a287","total_cost_usd":0.69191225,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":49125,"cache_read_input_tokens":19292,"output_tokens":15009,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":49125,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":15009,"cacheReadInputTokens":19292,"cacheCreationInputTokens":49125,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.69191225,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"uuid":"2908d9db-d694-42d4-bb48-525d9ba66d7c"}
